window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i> The last book in the New York Times best-selling dark romance series. Where love tries to triumph and darkness continues to reign...</i> </p> <p><i><b>\"I'm in love with her, but it might not be enough to stop her from becoming the latest victim of the Debt Inheritance. I know who I am now. I know what I must do. We will be together - I just hope it's on Earth rather than in heaven.\"</b></i> </p> <p><b>It all comes down to this.</b> </p> <p><b>Love versus life.</b> </p> <p><b>Debts versus death.</b> </p> <p><b>Who will win?</b> </p>"; 
